{"title":"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317096889b84df0b72bf69ceb4c82208305f1b0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, ..., <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> be positive real numbers such that \n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/6/5963cac8c96d5f27b431ca50755a0e1b60ed69c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1+a_2+ ... +a_n)\\left( {1 \\over a_1} + {1 \\over a_2} + ... +{1 \\over a_n} \\right) \\le \\left(n+ {1 \\over 2} \\right) ^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"427\" height=\"46\" /></center>\n<p>Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee46599b16fa963364e9e871694997e820e143a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{max}(a_1, a_2, ... ,a_n) \\le  4 \\text{min}(a_1, a_2, ... , a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"303\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume without loss of generality that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/2/a423af4c40d67e8b366980f29500a877bafc5edf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 \\geq a_2 \\geq \\cdots \\geq a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />. Now we seek to prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a08e507b5a45dd37843496da7b2f25485e77ea56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 \\le 4a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cauchy-Schwarz_Inequality\" title=\"Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality\">Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd3442c24b45816495ddee2754070ecef59d328a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (a_n+a_2+ a_3 + ... +a_{n-1}+a_1)\\left({1 \\over a_1} + {1 \\over a_2} + ... +{1 \\over a_n}\\right) &amp;\\ge \\left( \\sqrt{a_n \\over a_1} + n-2 + \\sqrt{a_1 \\over a_n} \\right)^2 \\\\ (n+ {1 \\over 2})^2 &amp;\\ge \\left( \\sqrt{a_n \\over a_1} + n-2 + \\sqrt{a_1 \\over a_n} \\right)^2 \\\\   n+ {1 \\over 2} &amp;\\ge n-2 + \\sqrt{a_n \\over a_1} + \\sqrt{a_1 \\over a_n} \\\\ {5 \\over 2} &amp;\\ge \\sqrt{a_n \\over a_1} + \\sqrt{a_1 \\over a_n} \\\\ {17 \\over 4} &amp;\\ge {a_n \\over a_1} + {a_1 \\over a_n} \\\\  0 &amp;\\ge (a_1 - 4a_n)\\left(a_1 - {a_n \\over 4}\\right) \\end{align*}\" width=\"644\" height=\"286\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/6/ea6e6f07d81f1c25f8a26c0819e7b49d0294d198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 \\ge a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />, clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c44b3a03aeac06a2f5a9d46abcb0e3d95ee5b684.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1 - {a_n \\over 4}) &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"33\" />, dividing yields:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/9/079a0194bdb6864170eaea10173bb219916e0481.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 \\ge (a_1 - 4a_n) \\Longrightarrow 4a_n \\ge a_1\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p>as desired.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume without loss of generality that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/2/a423af4c40d67e8b366980f29500a877bafc5edf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 \\geq a_2 \\geq \\cdots \\geq a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />.\nUsing the Cauchy–Bunyakovsky–Schwarz inequality and the inequality given, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d80f617b65e8e348fb4d000a66178540d572bee4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} &amp;\\left(a_1+a_2 + ... +a_n + 3a_n -\\frac{3a_1}{4}\\right)\\left({1 \\over a_1} + {1 \\over a_2} + ... +{1 \\over a_n}\\right) \\\\ =&amp;\\left(\\frac{a_1}{4}+a_2 + ... +a_{n-1}+4a_n\\right)\\left({1 \\over a_1} + {1 \\over a_2} + ... +{1 \\over a_n}\\right) \\\\ \\ge&amp; \\left(\\frac{1}{2}+n-2+2\\right)^2 \\\\ =&amp;\\left(n+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2 \\\\ \\ge&amp; (a_1+a_2 + ... +a_{n})\\left({1 \\over a_1} + {1 \\over a_2} + ... +{1 \\over a_n}\\right).\\end{align*}\" width=\"451\" height=\"247\" />\n(Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/e/beefd5048964fa70dab8d5c777682a35f948fc46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2 \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317096889b84df0b72bf69ceb4c82208305f1b0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" /> as given!)\nThis implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/f/48fbe325e02723201a06d4cf40854314c5aec6af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a_n -\\frac{3a_1}{4} \\ge 0 \\iff 4a_n \\ge a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"234\" height=\"38\" /> as desired.\n</p><p>~Deng Tianle, username: Leole\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO\" title=\"2009 USAMO\">2009 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017222136\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 132/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1313/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4283/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.538      1 -total\n 55.38%    6.944      1 Template:USAMO_newbox\n 42.12%    5.281      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8211:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017222136 and revision id 222208. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}